I would almost define a new Pantheon primitive:

Projection Calculus

A projection is a renderer.

A delta is information.

An invariant is what survives.

A hypothesis is what explains the deltas.

That creates a workflow:

1. Generate many projections.
2. Compute invariants.
3. Compute disagreements.
4. Ask why the disagreements exist.
5. Refine the model.
6. Compress into an operator.

